{"title":"2003 USAMO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>32nd <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=USAMO\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"USAMO\">USAMO</a></b> was held on April 29&#8211;30, 2003. The first link contains the full set of test problems.  The rest contain each individual problem and its solution.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_USAMO_Problems\" title=\"2003 USAMO Problems\">Entire Test</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_USAMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 USAMO Problems/Problem 1\"> Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_USAMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 USAMO Problems/Problem 2\"> Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_USAMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 USAMO Problems/Problem 3\"> Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_USAMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 USAMO Problems/Problem 4\"> Problem 4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_USAMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 USAMO Problems/Problem 5\"> Problem 5</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 USAMO Problems/Problem 6\"> Problem 6</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_USAMO&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.unl.edu/amc/a-activities/a7-problems/USAMO-IMO/q-usamo/-tex/usamo2003.tex\">USAMO 2003 (.TEX file)</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.unl.edu/amc/a-activities/a7-problems/USAMO-IMO/q-usamo/-pdf/usamo2003.pdf\">USAMO 2003 (PDF)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" cl